"ec0 cycle" invokes "talker_talk0" [order: 0].
"ec0 cycle" invokes itself.

"listener_listen0" is a process [role: process, name: listener_listen0, type: listener_listen].
"listener_listen0" yields "listener_listen0 out".
"listener_listen0" requires "talker_talk0 out" [arg: arg1, arg_index: 0, connection: push, connection_name: con0].

"listener_listen0 out" is an object [role: value, value_kind: output].

"talker_listener" is an object [role: system, name: talker_listener].
"talker_listener" consists of "ec0".
"talker_listener" exhibits "listener_listen0".
"talker_listener" exhibits "talker_talk0".

"talker_talk0" is a process [role: process, name: talker_talk0, type: talker_talk].
